00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:08.000
*unenthusiastically cheers*

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:08.800
That was hard.

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:10.060
*Darkiplier* 'DEAD SETTLEMENT'.

