00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:17.100
Oh yea, whatever.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:17.920
Go away birdie!

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:20.000
We didn't [??] welcome here anyway.

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:22.860
Just me and my son's favorite pastime of riding

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:23.980
the electrical wire.

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:24.660
Well, that was fun

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:25.520
