00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:40.540
We'll get in here-

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:41.700
Ohhhh hello!

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:43.760
Well. I made it, apparently!

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:45.680
Our one chance paid off.

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:47.560
Don't know where we're going now!

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.940
Seems to be a neighborhood of treehouses,

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:51.300
