00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:53.580
Hello!

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:54.480
Oh!

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.060
I don't know why it was called Dead Settlement,

00:08:58.060 --> 00:08:59.140
